ns KVK benaderd voor onderzoek. Klopt dit?","seodescription":"Via verschillende e-mailadressen benaderen onderzoekers ondernemers om hun mening te vragen over KVK.","seonoindex":false,"contentType":"seosupport:seo"},"intro":"KVK werkt samen met externe partners om via klantonderzoek ondernemers beter te leren kennen. De inzichten uit het onderzoek gebruikt KVK om haar dienstverlening te verbeteren. De onderzoekers benaderen ondernemers meestal per e-mail, soms ook telefonisch.","metadata":{"name":"kvkwebsite:metadata","displayName":"kvkwebsite:metadata","sdgCompliant":false,"editorialPublicationDateWithDefault":1792419335702,"editorialModificationDate":1792417080000,"overviewPageLinkLabel":"","overviewPageLink":"","editorialModificationDateLabel":"Bijgewerkt","sdgcompliant":false,"readingTime":1,"contentType":"kvkwebsite:metadata","editorialPublicationDate":null,"mostRecentChangeDate":1792417080000,"phase":[],"theme":[{"name":"selection:listitem","displayName":"selection:listitem","key":"6","label":"Veilig zakendoen","contentType":"selection:listitem","id":"705bdfb4-2227-413b-b909-1e83dada2ff8"}],"transaction":[],"organization":[{"name":"selection:listitem","displayName":"selection:listitem","key":"1","label":"Over KVK","contentType":"selection:listitem","id":"5b24e070-826c-4420-ad4c-780266977167"}],"subject":[{"name":"selection:listitem","displayName":"selection:listitem","key":"11","label":"Cybersecurity","contentType":"selection:listitem","id":"fd71c012-86ba-4abb-a655-6c64fb8dda94"}],"sector":[],"audience":[],"articleType":null,"author":[],"contentTeam":[{"name":"selection:listitem","displayName":"selection:listitem","key":"wrr","label":"WRR","contentType":"selection:listitem","id":"d7a9554f-5ea2-4134-9a38-7de44340b812"}],"lawOpenGovernment":[null]},"title":"Ik ben namens KVK benaderd voor onderzoek. Klopt dit?","image":{"$ref":"#u5012f98bc0634f09a524a06d3ae1270d"},"teaser":{"name":"kvkwebsite:teaser","displayName":"kvkwebsite:teaser","description":"Via verschillende e-mailadressen benaderen onderzoekers ondernemers om hun mening te vragen over KVK.","title":"Ik ben namens KVK benaderd voor onderzoek. Klopt dit?","image":null,"contentType":"kvkwebsite:teaser"},"pageNotifications":{"name":"kvkwebsite:pageNotifications","displayName":"kvkwebsite:pageNotifications","pageNotifications":[],"contentType":"kvkwebsite:pageNotificationContainer"},"primaryDocumentInRequest":false,"localeString":"nl","contentType":"kvkwebsite:inspirationDocument","systemCreationDate":1725982337458,"systemModificationDate":1792419332561,"systemPublicationDate":1792419335702,"id":"646ec3b5-ecdc-4f5c-a45a-8864b7e20221"}},"u3676bd8a7d05454a8cd7523b841ad366":{"type":"document","links":{"site":{"href":"/geldzaken/najaarstips-voor-ondernemers-8-slimme-acties-voor-1-januari/","type":"internal"}},"meta":{},"data":{"name":"najaarstips-voor-ondernemers-8-slimme-acties-voor-1-januari","displayName":"Najaarstips voor ondernemers: 8 slimme acties voor 1 januari","seo":{"name":"kvkwebsite:seo","displayName":"kvkwebsite:seo","seotitle":"8 najaarstips voor ondernemers vóór 1 januari","seodescription":"Bekijk welke keuzes je voor je bedrijf nog vóór 1 januari kunt maken. Van investeringen en auto van de zaak tot btw en pensioen.","seonoindex":false,"contentType":"seosupport:seo"},"intro":"Wil je belastingvoordeel benutten, kosten beperken en financiële verrassingen voorkomen? Het najaar is het moment om vooruit te kijken naar 2027. En beslissingen te nemen voor de ontwikkeling van je bedrijf. Sommige keuzes maak je beter nog vóór 1 januari. Bekijk welke van de 8 najaarstips voor jou interessant zijn.","metadata":{"name":"kvkwebsite:metadata","displayName":"kvkwebsite:metadata","sdgCompliant":false,"editorialPublicationDateWithDefault":1791804660000,"editorialModificationDate":1792591500000,"overviewPageLinkLabel":"","overviewPageLink":"","editorialModificationDateLabel":"Bijgewerkt","sdgcompliant":false,"readingTime":4,"contentType":"kvkwebsite:metadata","editorialPublicationDate":1791804660000,"mostRecentChangeDate":1792591500000,"phase":[{"name":"selection:listitem","displayName":"selection:listitem","key":"2","label":"Runnen en groeien","contentType":"selection:listitem","id":"fc3e09d7-df31-4749-a4d2-2689d8fc01e2"}],"theme":[{"name":"selection:listitem","displayName":"selection:listitem","key":"2","label":"Geldzaken","contentType":"selection:listitem","id":"72926466-9b4d-4d40-9eb4-bd80dcae2295"}],"transaction":[],"organization":[],"subject":[{"name":"selection:listitem","displayName":"selection:listitem","key":"7","label":"Belastingen","contentType":"selection:listitem","id":"f5024357-07cf-4c0c-a8da-f3c8afdfa9c7"}],"sector":[],"audience":[{"name":"selection:listitem","displayName":"selection:listitem","key":"1","label":"ZZP","contentType":"selection:listitem","id":"b03acec6-5662-43ab-a10d-e2e22c7f0da5"},{"name":"selection:listitem","displayName":"selection:listitem","key":"2","label":"Micro-MKB","contentType":"selection:listitem","id":"92f7f673-f3fd-4021-b827-bb7cb926679d"}],"articleType":{"name":"selection:listitem","displayName":"selection:listitem","key":"1","label":"Achtergrond","contentType":"selection:listitem","id":"59d14c68-fbb8-4a64-9be0-7633b09fc7f5"},"author":[{"name":"selection:listitem","displayName":"selection:listitem","key":"ge-sletterink","label":"Gé Sletterink","contentType":"selection:listitem","id":"da0b4071-b4c4-4453-a713-ca5b452b8e29"}],"contentTeam":[{"name":"selection:listitem","displayName":"selection:listitem","key":"thunderbirds","label":"Thunderbirds","contentType":"selection:listitem","id":"d528e480-7dad-4837-a4a6-ab704062d7d7"}],"lawOpenGovernment":[null]},"title":"Najaarstips voor ondernemers: 8 slimme acties vóór 1 januari","image":{"$ref":"#u5343bec0babc40a187655d33007f5cbf"},"teaser":{"name":"kvkwebsite:teaser","displayName":"kvkwebsite:teaser","description":"Goed voorbereid beginnen aan 2027? Bekijk welke keuzes je nog vóór 1 januari kunt maken voor je auto, investeringen, btw en uurtarief.",